<title>USA: TABLE - Block Drug Co Inc Q1 shr flat.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Block Drug Co Inc Q1 shr flat.</headline>
<dateline>JERSEY CITY, N.J. 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>BLOCK DRUG COMPANY, INC.</p>
<p>			CONSOLIDATED STATEMENTS OF INCOME(a)</p>
<p>						 For the First Quarter</p>
<p>						    Ended June 30,</p>
<p>						    1997	     1996</p>
<p> Net Sales			    $200,206,000    $205,507,000</p>
<p>Income From Operations</p>
<p>  and Provision for Taxes	   20,786,000	21,990,000</p>
<p> Net Income			     15,381,000	15,415,000</p>
<p>Average Number of Shares</p>
<p>  Outstanding			   21,483,816   21,444,291(b)</p>
<p> Net Income per Share:			0.72		0.72</p>
<p>(a) Unaudited</p>
<p>(b) Restated for the 3% stock dividend</p>
<p>NOTE: Sales were hurt by foreign currency transactions. Sales would have increased by one percent if currencies were stable in comparable periods.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
